      "cooked": "<p>I wanted to add a text field for each <strong>item group,</strong> so that when I select any item group in NEW ITEM the text field shows respectively.</p>\n<p>Here is what I did</p>\n<ol>\n<li>I went to Item group</li>\n<li>click Customize, and added a <strong>Small Text</strong> field named as <strong>Category Attributes</strong>.</li>\n<li>Then I wen to <strong>ITEM</strong> and added a <strong>link</strong> field to <strong>category attributes</strong> from <strong>Item group</strong>.</li>\n<li>Everything is working fine and desired data is fetched but when I save the item, an error shows.<br>\n”Could not find Category Attributes: Brand - Ply - Size - PO+Ratio Details - Quality - Separator Citi Trends - 7 PLY Corrugated - 62x33x30 - 159807 - Ratio - Corrugated - Separator - White Paper Pasting”<br>\n**how can I fix this?<br>\n**<br>\nI have attached pictures for visual aid</li>\n</ol>\n<ol>\n<li></li>\n</ol>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/4/d/4db140449477fbfaf44506891c6ee1f29a7c34d7.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/4db140449477fbfaf44506891c6ee1f29a7c34d7\" title=\"Screenshot 2025-12-15 130843\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/d/4db140449477fbfaf44506891c6ee1f29a7c34d7_2_690x349.png\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-12-15 130843\" data-base62-sha1=\"b5iwtDMf7VcZqQKk2N30YNkolJZ\" width=\"690\" height=\"349\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/d/4db140449477fbfaf44506891c6ee1f29a7c34d7_2_690x349.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/d/4db140449477fbfaf44506891c6ee1f29a7c34d7_2_1035x523.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/4/d/4db140449477fbfaf44506891c6ee1f29a7c34d7_2_1380x698.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F8F8F7\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href